# One child per line: id|executable-path|arguments|working-directory|restart-on-exit
# Every valid row starts once. Set restart-on-exit to true for bounded restart, false for one-shot execution.
# Arguments are intentionally never written to host logs or state files.
# Inline token/password/secret/api-key flags and URLs with userinfo are rejected. Use a protected config-file reference instead.
# The installer writes the commissioned file under ProgramData. Example:
# RadioTEDU: backend|C:\Program Files\RadioTEDU\OnAir\backend\RadioTEDU-OnAir-Backend.exe|--host 127.0.0.1 --port 8100|C:\Program Files\RadioTEDU\OnAir\backend|true
